    <guid isPermaLink="false">6995c0c7de29766da9df0ae7</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Feb 2026 13:44:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>此次音频搬山因为敷面膜声音有点奇怪请大家谅解</span></p><span></span><p><span>（部分图片来自小红书搜索）</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐民宿名称：云栖小园</span></p><span></span><p><span>善化寺四个菩萨</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnyfRDN0EMTfuopxyyHhNtbFUjr2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>这是美丽的胁侍菩萨</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoT0VXiXL8MDs9MfM_IofyyS9mx-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>这里忘记讲善化寺的大吉祥天，在40分的时候讲鬼子母对面那个诸天就是大吉祥诸天。补上图片</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgpqqHDQ3TaOegNBNNOtQ0KckJIk.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>善化寺鬼子母诸天</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpgMohT5ABCD0E8kl8-dQpSsJU1Z.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>大同推荐店铺：北魏家宴菜胡饼与太后贡米</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhw9tW_bnxg9WQ_-X8YejYU6sCOr.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmE7CXcrI95fa6ryLm9Q9Ecap-da.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>浑源推荐店铺：蔡家酒楼</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrjJYURpQTbNuN5uMgGKpyTmG1f1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>55分初云岗为北魏说成了辽代在此纠正</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后就不放建筑图啦希望大家去山西好好探索!!!</span></p>]]></description>
